comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-16T05:11:38.233Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence 2026-08-16: searched all 2,501 items across every status for GH-1036,GH-1040,cross-version history drift,item_hash_version disagreement,mutually exclusive repair,and merge-reconcile compatibility. Closed pm-2htk4p fixes a narrower repeated-tests hash-version defect and pm-9j2r3b covers merge history anchoring; neither owns symmetric released-version verdicts or repair refusal. One canonical item covers #1036 and its corrected root-cause report #1040."
  "2026-08-16T05:12:49.971Z","harness:codex","GitHub linkage evidence: #1036 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1036#issuecomment-5305855426 and #1040 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1040#issuecomment-5305855572 point both corrected reports to this canonical PM item."
  "2026-08-16T05:20:50.785Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: ambiguous implicit history hashes were detected as epoch 2, proving repair can rewrite a legacy stream into a form older released CLIs reject. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/core/history/history-hash-version.spec.ts."
  "2026-08-16T06:16:08.850Z","harness:codex","Green evidence: implicit history streams are deterministically legacy epoch 1 while explicit epoch 2 remains stable; focused verification/repair tests passed. Packed-package history repair dry-run passed. Exact repository coverage is 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-16T06:41:17.242Z","harness:codex","Gate finding: repository tracker-context-quality proved the initial implicit-v1-only implementation regressed 14 live transitional streams. history-repair --all --dry-run identified 12 rehash candidates and 2 false-positive clean streams. Work continues; no repair was applied and no ratchet was weakened."
  "2026-08-16T06:57:46.081Z","harness:codex","Final compatibility evidence: the verifier prefers implicit epoch 1 only when both algorithms match, accepts transitional unversioned epoch 2 when its order-sensitive hash is required, and continues to refuse unsupported explicit epochs. Live pm health is green; history-repair --all --dry-run scanned 2,504 streams with zero drift and zero writes. Final repository coverage passed 506 files and 7,402 tests at exact 53,647/53,647 statements, 39,667/39,667 branches, 11,014/11,014 functions, and 51,809/51,809 lines."
  "2026-08-16T07:05:17.187Z","harness:codex","Delivery: PR #1041 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1041 carries this context-integrity tranche; initial implementation commit b9ef9470eed45b74353864743df5b4d4718a0bc4 passed local exact coverage and repository gates. Hosted exact-head checks and bot review are pending."
  "2026-08-16T07:22:53.672Z","harness:codex","Review TDD red evidence: an explicit epoch-2 entry followed by an ambiguous unversioned entry verified as epoch 1 and could select epoch 1 for repair."
  "2026-08-16T07:50:53.154Z","harness:codex","Final green evidence: explicit-epoch-plus-ambiguous-tail regression and repair contract passed; packed history-repair dry-run passed; repository exact coverage and record-integrity gates passed."
  "2026-08-16T08:29:50.093Z","harness:codex","Review TDD plan: add a valid unversioned epoch-1 prefix followed by an explicit epoch-2 marker; current global marker scan is expected to reject the prefix before the implementation becomes replay-order aware."
  "2026-08-16T08:32:27.537Z","harness:codex","Review TDD red evidence: valid epoch-1 prefix followed by explicit epoch-2 marker failed verification because the later marker constrained the earlier entry."
  "2026-08-16T08:57:30.732Z","harness:codex","Final review-hardening green evidence: a valid unversioned epoch-1 prefix followed by an explicit epoch-2 marker now verifies; the marker becomes authoritative only for itself and later entries. Linked verification passed 11 tests, and the definitive repository run passed 7,404 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 plus record-integrity and all strict quality gates."
